# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules

# ===== 构建产物（CI 自产，release artifact 通过 ui-dist/ 转发）=====
# Vite 默认输出目录；本地 build / `vite preview` 写到此处。
# CI 流程：npm run build → check:bundle → cp -r dist/ ui-dist/ → artifact。
# Release job 从 artifact 恢复 `gateway-web/dist/`，见 .github/workflows/ci.yml。
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
*.tsbuildinfo

# ===== 测试产物 =====
# coverage/ 为 vitest 生成的 HTML 覆盖率报告；.vitest/ 为 json reporter 输出。
coverage
.vitest

# Playwright E2E 产物（trace/screenshot/video 失败时保留在本地，CI 另传 artifact）
playwright-report
test-results

# ===== 临时/缓存 =====
.cache
.parcel-cache
.eslintcache
.vite
.turbo
*.tgz

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
